<title>UK: CRICKET-NOTTINGHAMSHIRE V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NOTTINGHAMSHIRE V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>final day of the three-day cricket match between Nottinghamshire</p>
<p>and Australia at Trent Bridge on Friday:</p>
<p>Nottinghamshire first innings 239 (N.Astle 99; G.McGrath</p>
<p>4-63; P.Reiffel 3-15)</p>
<p>Australia first innings (overnight 51-1)</p>
<p> M.Elliott b Afzaal	  127</p>
<p> M.Slater lbw b Evans	 14</p>
<p> R.Ponting lbw b Pick	 19</p>
<p> M.Waugh c Astle b Dowman   29</p>
<p> S.Waugh c Afzaal b Dowman 115</p>
<p> M.Bevan not out		75</p>
<p> A.Gilchrist not out	   9</p>
<p> Extras (b-3 lb-3 w-4)	10</p>
<p> Total (for five wickets)  398</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-29 2-55 3-133 4-250 5-382</p>
<p>Did not bat: B.Julian, P.Reiffel, M.Kasprowicz, G.McGrath</p>
<p>Bowling: Franks 18-3-54-0, Pick 13-0-62-1, Evans 15-1-51-1,</p>
<p>Oram 5-1-14-0, Astle 13-1-37-0, Dowman 16-0-78-2, Afzaal</p>
<p>15.2-1-96-1.</p>
<p>Result: Match drawn</p>
